WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.960
Buying your first home can feel like a big step

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.080
It often begins before you have even found the right property

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.560
The first thing to understand is what you could borrow

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.260
You may be able to borrow more than you expect and it helps to know that as you start looking

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.220
Mortgage Easy helps you get started

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.860
You can explore in your own time or book a conversation when you are ready

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.920
That technology means your advisor already understands your situation and can focus on what matters most

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:40.020
When choosing a mortgage your advisor will help you find an option that is right for your circumstances

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.520
They can also help you prepare to make an offer

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:48.060
When the time is right your advisor can provide an agreement in principle

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.040
giving you confidence that you are ready to move forward

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.160
From your initial application to completion

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.700
your advisor works with your convener and estate agent

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.920
And when you finally open the door to your new home it is your moment and you will have felt more supported

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:05.460
Your journey

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:06.500
made easier

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.080
Understand what you can borrow

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.740
Find a mortgage that fits you

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.300
Get your agreement in principle

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.980
Make your offer with confidence

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:18.580
Move in

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.160
protected for what matters
